load balancer is the one which handles the client requests and distribute them over the multiple backend servers

the primary goal of this to not overload a single server from overloading and leadint ot failure, maximize application uptime and ensures high performance

it pings the servers in between and check whether the servers are running healthy or not 

it also helps to decrypt the requests safely and pass the http data to the internal servers and lets the server not to take extra processing and purely concentrate on the application logic

